"inlineContent":[{"code":"onAuthorization","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is called ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"before polling begins","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" and is the only place the user code","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and verification URI are surfaced. §14.3 rule 2 is explicit that an SDK must not print","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them to stdout on the caller’s behalf — a device shows them however it can: a screen, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"QR code, an e-ink panel.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The returned token set is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not adopted","type":"text"}]},{"text":" as this client’s credential. Adoption is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same MAY as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loginClientCredentials"},{"text":" (§14.3 rule 4), and this SDK takes one posture","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"everywhere: return the tokens, install nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Polling follows §14.2 exactly: the interval starts at the server’s, ","type":"text"},{"code":"slow_down","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" adds 5 s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"permanently, and the loop stops at ","type":"text"},{"code":"expires_in","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" even if the server has not yet said so.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/devicelogin(scope:tenantid:configuration:onauthorization:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC11deviceLogin5scope8tenantID13configuration15onAuthorization